          "targetDoi": "10.1016/b978-0-444-89007-8.50106-4",
          "snippet": "Practically, a coarser description of the system in replace of the master equation is needed, which is now known as the Fokker-Planck equation (F-P equation for short). The F-P equation has been applied to fields as diverse as quantum optics, 21 micromacro coupling models of polymeric fluids, 22 biochemical oscillations, 23 electric circuits and laser arrays, population dynamics and stock marketing 24 etc..",
